{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10106380","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10106380","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010638001:1":{"text":"どうした、ウサ耳？船に何か問題でもあったか？","source_cn":"兔耳朵，怎么了？船有问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EEF4DAD9D2624AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010638002:1":{"text":"問題ありません！ボクが来たときと全く同じ状態でプカプカ浮いてます！ただちょっと動きたがらないだけで……","source_cn":"没有，它好好的，和我来时一样安稳地在码头睡着呢，就是不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA534D1DFBD60F840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010638003:1":{"text":"今のユグドラシルは混乱の真っただ中だぞ。本当に行くのか？","source_cn":"薄暮丛林最近乱的很，你们非去不可？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x378A91D7A6DFFAC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010638004:1":{"text":"その混乱を解決しに行くんです！","source_cn":"我们就是去解决乱子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2628D41120FDCF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010638005:1":{"text":"お前なぁ……まあいい。ヴェルディア連盟の人間なら、問題は無いだろ。","source_cn":"你……好吧。毕竟是绿裔联盟的人，也许不会有问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C6C28C5B5BB1780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010638006:1":{"text":"いいか、俺は送り届けるだけだからな。他は一切関与しねぇぞ！","source_cn":"不过说好，我只负责送你们过去，其他的事我就不管了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE474A4CDFA72993F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010638007:1":{"text":"ええ、もちろんです！","source_cn":"当然、当然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026E79DD6E6F6B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010638008:1":{"text":"じゃあ、いつも通りな。","source_cn":"那就还是老样子，老规矩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8F32198E20064E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010638009:1":{"text":"あのぅ……できれば少し場所を空けてくれませんか？ボクの客人を荷物と一緒に座らせるわけには……","source_cn":"呃——麻烦你多收拾收拾，这几位是我请的客人，不能让他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB98447481CC7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1010638009":{"text":"あのぅ……できれば少し場所を空けてくれませんか？ボクの客人を荷物と一緒に座らせるわけには……","source_cn":"呃——麻烦你多收拾收拾，这几位是我请的客人，不能让他们和我一样挤货舱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB98447481CC7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010638010:1":{"text":"各地を渡り歩くのにお金が必要で……ボクだけなら我慢できますけど、